格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"🖥️ Agent-project workbench for DeepSeek Harness — sidebar app drawer + dockable split workspace + a live control room watching every project.","id":"gh:1336092482","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-worktable","slug":"Aisland-SJL/dsh-worktable","topics":["agent","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","productivity","web-gui","workspace","worktable"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"🖥️ Agent-project workbench for DeepSeek Harness — sidebar app drawer + dockable split workspace + a "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"live control room watching every project."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-worktable 🖥️"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**An agent-project workbench for DeepSeek Harness** — a sidebar app drawer that turns every project "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"into dockable windows, plus a built-in control room that watches them all in real time."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> Source version **0.5.1** adds exact DSH **0.2.1-rc.5** compatibility, neutral run-ended status and"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" assistant-only previews, and fixes downgrade alerts caused by prerelease comparison and stale updat"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"e caches. Publication status follows GitHub Releases. Existing sandbox/authentication boundaries rem"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"ain; this is not a fix for the separate old-session HTTP 400 issue."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> Compatibility is limited to the tested DSH versions **0.2.0-rc.2 / 0.2.1-rc.3 / 0.2.1-rc.5** on Wi"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ndows; coverage varies by environment. The user confirmed that the downgrade alert disappeared and t"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"he page looked normal after installing 0.5.1-dev.3. This confirmation and earlier candidate GUI chec"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"ks do not establish full final-package Desktop acceptance. DSH 0.1.x is outside this release’s suppo"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"rt range. Version 0.5.1 retains the identity checks, page isolation, preview limits and layout fixes"},{"id":"p6s6","text":" introduced in 0.5.0. Embedded storage, login, WebGL textures and automatic annotation text extracti"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"on can be affected. See compatibility and security for evidence and limits."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## 📸 Screenshots"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"|  | **🖥️ Control room** — the built-in default project: a live card grid watching every project (wo"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"rking / needs you / run ended) with glassmorphism cards on a blueprint grid |\n|  | **🧩 Worktable sid"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"ebar** — the app drawer: projects, shortcuts and the pinned control-room entry |\n|  | **🪟 Our projec"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"ts** — every project opens as a dockable split workspace (resident apps like Travel Atlas included) "},{"id":"p8s5","text":"s** — every project opens as a dockable split workspace (resident apps like Travel Atlas included) |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## ✨ Feature tour"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### 🧩 Sidebar app drawer"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- Collects your self-hosted projects (and resident plugins like dsh-travelatlas) in one place\n- Rena"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"me / icon / reorder / hide each project; per-project folder; **project ↔ conversation binding** — op"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"ening a project switches the chat pane to its bound conversation\n- Collapse the sidebar and every pr"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"oject becomes a tappable square tile (icon only)"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### 🪟 Dockable split workspace"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- Declarative layout presets (left column / top row / main grid + right chat pane)\n- Draggable divid"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ers, per-pane tabs, per-layout width persistence\n- Built-in panes: **file explorer, terminal, browse"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"r, animation site, custom window**\n- Custom window: send a requirement to a new or existing conversa"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"tion; the agent builds it and the result auto-mounts into the window (locked)"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### 🖥️ Control room (built-in default project)"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- A pinned, undeletable first project — bind one management conversation on first open\n- A configura"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ble card grid mirrors visible projects: working / needs you / run ended, with available runtime and "},{"id":"p15s3","text":"the latest readable assistant reply. Run ended does not indicate task success.\n- Event-driven host s"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"napshot mirroring; status monitoring does not call a model\n- Glassmorphism cards, dark / light / sys"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"tem theme, neon status glows and a rotating comet on busy cards"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## At a glance"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| 🧩 Plugin type | Cordis plugin — host routes + web client, pure additive (no official plugin replac"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ed) |\n| 🪟 Workspace engine | Self-built split engine rendered into the host shell overlay seat |\n| 💬"},{"id":"p17s3","text":" Chat pane | Reuses the host conversation; navigation uses the host's new or legacy session API |\n| "},{"id":"p17s4","text":"📡 Status data | Mirror of the host session runtime snapshots (subscription-driven) |\n| 💾 State | Pro"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"jects/layouts/bindings in localStorage; media in IndexedDB; file panes access configured project dir"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"ectories |\n| 🎨 UI | TypeScript + React (host externals) + vanilla CSS, dark-first with light theme |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Quick start (v0.5.1)"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The current compatibility declaration lists only DSH **0.2.0-rc.2 / 0.2.1-rc.3 / 0.2.1-rc.5**; DSH 0"},{"id":"p19s2","text":".1.x is not supported. The compatibility guide separates Windows Web checks from Desktop evidence. B"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ack up important data and check other plugins before upgrading; use GitHub Releases to confirm that "},{"id":"p19s4","text":"the requested version is published."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"1. **Install** (pick one):"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"**A · one-liner (recommended)** — straight from the GitHub Release tarball, no Git needed:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### v0.4.0 compatibility history"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"**v0.4.0** adds Windows official Desktop support within the tested scope below. Web compatibility li"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"sts only DSH **0.1.1-rc.2 / 0.1.2-rc.1 / 0.2.0-rc.2**; Desktop checks cover **Windows + 0.2.0-rc.2**"},{"id":"p25s3","text":". Desktop page checks and targeted regressions do not establish full final-package Desktop end-to-en"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"d acceptance. Older versions rely on prior page checks plus code regressions, not a newly repeated f"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"ull GUI suite. Back up important data and check other plugins before upgrading; GitHub Release is th"},{"id":"p25s6","text":"e publication authority."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"One package ships the **host Cordis plugin** and the **web client**:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- **host**: owner-checked file/Git/write/workspace routes and terminal WebSocket; public health and "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"random read-only preview capabilities are explicit exceptions. See the route and lifecycle reference"},{"id":"p28s3","text":".\n- **client**: injected into the sidebar and the shell overlay via the slot protocol; the split eng"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"ine, tab model, drag/drop and persistence are self-built\n- **control room**: reads the host session "},{"id":"p28s5","text":"list snapshot (running / pending / completed, jobs, subagent catalogs) — an event-driven mirror, no "},{"id":"p28s6","text":"model involvement\n- **window tasks**: custom tasks register project/pane/binding ownership and write"},{"id":"p28s7","text":" a dedicated result under `.dsh-worktable/project-<project ID>/`; sharing a folder does not make a n"},{"id":"p28s8","text":"ew project inherit another project's windows"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Privacy"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The plugin does not add an analytics service. Update checks use a read-only GitHub Releases request "},{"id":"p30s2","text":"and can be disabled in Settings. It also communicates with host APIs/WebSockets, loads user-selected"},{"id":"p30s3","text":" pages, and provides an interactive terminal whose commands can access files and the network. Prefer"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"ences and media use browser storage. See the permissions and external-services disclosure for file a"},{"id":"p30s5","text":"ccess, inherited terminal environment and other limits."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
